omadungeon (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A desktop theme swap no longer pauses at the end: theme writes happen with
    the theme detached from its controls, so eighty theme items no longer notify
    every Control eighty times. 4.9 s of stall became one 83 ms frame.

 -- ferrreo <harderthanfire@gmail.com>  Mon, 15 Sep 2026 00:20:00 +0100

omadungeon (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A desktop theme swap no longer stalls the game for seconds: the UI theme is
    written once at the end of the retint rather than on every frame of it, so
    Controls are not re-resolved 36 times over a 0.6 s fade.

 -- ferrreo <harderthanfire@gmail.com>  Sun, 14 Sep 2026 22:05:00 +0100

omadungeon (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Arch package depends on libpulse rather than the pulseaudio daemon, which
    conflicts with pipewire-pulse; this also fixes audio dropping out on Arch.
  * A desktop theme swap applies once instead of on every poll: the debounce was
    shorter than the poll interval feeding it, so it coalesced nothing.
  * Wallpaper measurements are cached by path and modified time.

 -- ferrreo <harderthanfire@gmail.com>  Mon, 14 Sep 2026 21:30:00 +0100

omadungeon (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Ship the Godot 4.7 export as a self-contained binary with an embedded PCK
    in /usr/lib/omadungeon/omadungeon, with a symlink at /usr/bin/omadungeon,
    matching the layout of packaging/PKGBUILD.
  * Install the desktop entry, the AppStream metainfo and hicolor icons at
    16, 32, 48, 64, 128 and 256 pixels.
  * Add the omadungeon-lite binary package: the same game built from the
    "Linux x86_64 (lite, no music)" export preset, without the bundled
    Omarchy Radio soundtrack. It conflicts with and replaces omadungeon.
  * Derive the runtime dependencies from the exported binary's dlopen set
    rather than from its ELF NEEDED list, which only names the C library;
    tools/check-deb-deps.sh regenerates and verifies the list.

 -- ferreo <ferreo@pika-os.com>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 02:01:51 +0100
